<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Concord 1996 net jumps 302 pct.</title>
<headline>Pacific Concord 1996 net jumps 302 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   28.73	 vs  7.15</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.83	  vs  1.75</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  458.18 gain vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    538.17	vs  133.95</p>
<p>    Turnover		     726.57	vs  932.55</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pacific Concord Holding Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 23-27</p>
<p>    Dividend		     July 9</p>
<p>NOTE - Pacific Concord manufactures and sells watches, watch components and cosmetics. It is also engaged in hotel management, beauty salons and travel agencies.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$532.23 million from the dilution of the group's interest through the placing and new issue of shares in Concord Land Development Co Ltd and loss of HK$74.05 million on provision for tax indemnity attributable to minority interest pursuant to the placing and new issue of shares in Concord Land Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 3.66 cents (including interim dividend of 1.83 cents) vs 3.58 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
